Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790467199999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "high", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790380799999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Upper tails show selling on the impulse bars: bar 1787270400000 (high 2771, close 2515.30, about a 256-point tail), bar 1789084800000 (high 2680, close 2514.72) and bar 1789344000000 (high 2609.02, close 2514.07).", "The 2850 high of bar 1789948800000 has no follow-through: the next four bars overlap between 2633.31 and 2786.81 and none closes above 2690.56.", "This advance follows a 54-bar band (1512.91-1974.46), one spike to 2771 and then a 20-bar range, so a second stalling range under 2850 is as consistent with the evidence as a fresh leg.", "The last four ranges (60.17, 145.44, 66.08, 73.20) are much smaller than the 208.30 range of bar 1789948800000, so momentum has not been re-confirmed by a further wide-range trend bar."], "evidence_for": ["Swing lows rise after the breakout (1905.63, 2111, 2325.31, 2357.18, 2358.62) while swing highs rise from 2293.80 to 2771 and then 2850, a higher-high/higher-low sequence across the last 38 bars.", "Impulse bars close near their highs: bar 1787097600000 close 2252.16 within 41.64 of its 2293.80 high, bar 1789689600000 close 2612.02 within 31.50 of its 2643.52 high, and bar 1789948800000 close 2775.61.", "The 20-bar range 2357.18-2557.46 held far above the bar-1787097600000 breakout level, and the close of 2612.02 (bar 1789689600000) shows acceptance above that range high rather than a return into it.", "The window's highest high (2850) and highest close (2775.61) both occur in the last five bars, and no bar closes below 2633.31, so the Always-In Long read has not been challenged by a reversal bar."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["The window opens with four bars chopping between 1958.77 and 2042.37 (bar 1780012800000 high 2042.37), then five consecutive lower closes from 1859.02 (bar 1780358400000) to 1568.55 (bar 1780704000000), whose low 1368.42 is the lowest price in the window.", "A second decline reaches 1512.91 (bar 1782432000000), after which bars 1782432000000 through 1787097599999 stay inside a wide band containing that low and the 1974.46 high (bar 1785110400000), with heavy bar overlap and no run of trend bars.", "Bar 1787097600000 opens 1916.51 and closes 2252.16 near its 2293.80 high, clearing the 1974.46 band high; bars 1787184000000 (close 2326.32) and 1787270400000 (high 2771, close 2515.30) extend it, the last leaving a large upper tail.", "Bars 1787356800000 through 1788998400000 hold between 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) and 2557.46 (bar 1787788800000): 20 overlapping bars whose closes all sit between 2391.94 and 2513.46.", "Bar 1789689600000 opens 2446.22 and closes 2612.02, above the 2557.46 range high; bar 1789948800000 prints the window high 2850 and closes 2775.61, the highest close of the window.", "The last four bars 1790035200000-1790294400000 overlap inside 2633.31-2786.81 with ranges of 60.17, 145.44, 66.08 and 73.20 versus 208.30 on bar 1789948800000; their closes are 2752.43, 2684.16, 2686.59 and 2690.56.", "Swing lows since the breakout rise in steps: 1905.63 (bar 1787097600000), 2111 (bar 1787184000000), 2325.31 (bar 1787270400000), 2357.18 (bar 1788307200000) and 2358.62 (bar 1789430400000), the last two forming an approximate double bottom."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Wide band that followed the opening decline: bars 1782432000000 to 1787097599999 oscillate between the 1512.91 low (bar 1782432000000) and the 1974.46 high (bar 1785110400000), with many overlapping bars and alternating closes.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1782432000000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull 